{"dependencies":["List.nil","Bool","BEq","List.brecOn","Bool.false","PProd","List","List.getLast?.match_1","Unit","List.below","List.filter.match_1","BEq.beq","List.cons","Bool.true"],"doc":"Checks whether `a` is an element of `l`, using `==` to compare elements.\n\n`O(|l|)`. `List.contains` is a synonym that takes the list before the element.\n\nThe preferred simp normal form is `l.contains a`. When `LawfulBEq α` is available,\n`l.contains a = true ↔ a ∈ l` and `l.contains a = false ↔ a ∉ l`.\n\nExample:\n* `List.elem 3 [1, 4, 2, 3, 3, 7] = true`\n* `List.elem 5 [1, 4, 2, 3, 3, 7] = false`\n","extra":null,"kind":"definition","levels":["u"],"module":"Init.Data.List.Basic","name":"List.elem","nodes":[["sort",["succ",["param","u"]]],["constant","BEq",[["param","u"]]],["bound",0],["apply",1,2],["bound",1],["constant","List",[["param","u"]]],["bound",2],["apply",5,6],["constant","Bool",[]],["forall","l",7,8,"explicit"],["forall","a",4,9,"explicit"],["forall","inst._@.Init.Data.List.Basic.1652304932._hygCtx._hyg.5",3,10,"instance"],["forall","α",0,11,"implicit"],["constant","List.brecOn",[["succ",["zero"]],["param","u"]]],["bound",3],["apply",13,14],["apply",5,14],["lambda","x._@.Init.Data.List.Basic.1652304932._hygCtx._hyg.13",16,8,"explicit"],["apply",15,17],["apply",18,2],["constant","List.below",[["succ",["zero"]],["param","u"]]],["bound",4],["apply",20,21],["apply",5,21],["lambda","x._@.Init.Data.List.Basic.1652304932._hygCtx._hyg.13",23,8,"explicit"],["apply",22,24],["apply",25,2],["constant","List.getLast?.match_1",[["param","u"],["succ",["param","u"]]]],["bound",5],["apply",27,28],["apply",5,28],["bound",6],["apply",20,31],["apply",5,31],["lambda","x._@.Init.Data.List.Basic.1652304932._hygCtx._hyg.13",33,8,"explicit"],["apply",32,34],["apply",35,2],["forall","x._@.Init.Data.List.Basic.1652304932._hygCtx._hyg.64",36,8,"explicit"],["lambda","x._@.Init.Data.List.Basic.1652304932._hygCtx.13.Init.Data.List.Basic.1652304932._hygCtx._hyg.24",30,37,"explicit"],["apply",2