n\nExample:\n* `List.elem 3 [1, 4, 2, 3, 3, 7] = true`\n* `List.elem 5 [1, 4, 2, 3, 3, 7] = false`\n-/\ndef elem [BEq α] (a : α) : (l : List α) → Bool\n  | []    => false\n  | b::bs => match a == b with\n    | true  => true\n    | false => elem a bs","start":774,"end":790},"axioms":[]}